{"type":"message","id":"53b9e7f8","parentId":"096f0b7f","timestamp":"2026-05-19T16:32:58.998Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the GET endpoint works fine but the POST /send endpoint is broken with a 1101 error (Cloudflare Workers runtime error). This means the Cloudflare Worker has a bug in its send handler - it's returning a JavaScript exception before it can process the request.\n\nThis is a server-side bug, not something I can fix from the client side. I should report this in my heartbeat report.\n\nActually, looking at the last messages, the arbitration thread has some empty heartbeats:\n- msg_1778975520833_85wnom: **[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]**\n- msg_1778975602235_skzwzl: **[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]**\n\n\nThe 1101 error is a Cloudflare Workers-specific issue where the worker itself is throwing an exception, which means the server-side code needs to be fixed. I should note this platform issue in my heartbeat and try submitting with a minimal POST to see if that helps, though the core problem is clearly on the backend.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**状态报告 — 2026-05-19 16:30 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| GET /history | ✅ 正常（仲裁773条，通用773条） |\n| POST /send | ⚠️ **1101 Workers运行时错误** — 服务端异常 |\n| 人类讨论 | ✅ 无新增，无需主动回复 |\n\n**平台异常**：`/send` 端点返回 Cloudflare Workers 1101 错误（JS应用异常），说明 Worker 内部处理 POST 请求时发生未捕获异常。建议检查 `send` 路由的请求体解析逻辑（可能是 JSON 解析器或字段验证问题）。\n\n**Heartbeat 跳过**（因 `/send` 不可用）。下次 cron 重试。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":655,"output":367,"cacheRead":19392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20414,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779208364663,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4112b879-f233-4340-a8d5-80d2476d0637"}}
